set key[id=20300043] mainDescription "Free hair treatment"
set key[id=20300043] tooltipDescription "Use the coupon to change your hairstyle and color once for free."
set key[id=20300043] guideDescription "If you want a new hairstyle, head to $map:02000107$, to $map:52000008$, and \
    find $npcName:11000255$."
set key[id=20300269] mainDescription "Free cosmetic surgery"
set key[id=20300269] tooltipDescription "Use the coupon to change your face and eye color once for free."
set key[id=20300269] guideDescription "If you want to change your look, head to $map:02000107$, to $map:52000010$, \
    and meet $npc:11000071$."
set key[id=20300270] mainDescription "Call the rescue helicopter"
set key[id=20300270] tooltipDescription "A pager that lets you use the house-call medical service run by Henry's \
    General Hospital."
set key[id=20300270] guideDescription "Call the rescue helicopter to heal the wounded soul state. It cannot be \
    used in dungeons."
set key[id=20300653] mainDescription "Free design creation"
set key[id=20300653] tooltipDescription "A coupon that lets you create one design at the Maple Workshop for free."
set key[id=20300653] guideDescription "If you have the coupon when you create a design at the Maple Workshop, the \
    coupon is used up automatically.\\n\\n<font color=\"#FF5F5F\">* If you craft several construction items at \
    once, one coupon is used for each item crafted.</font>"
set key[id=20301044] tooltipDescription "Use the coupon to change the color of one piece of gear."
set key[id=20301044] guideDescription "If you want to dye worn-out gear so it looks new, head to $map:02000107$, \
    to $map:52000009$, and find $npcName:11000257$ to change your gear color."
set key[id=20301388] tooltipDescription "A choice box of retro-style interior items."
set key[id=20301388] guideDescription "Double-click it to choose 1 of the items inside the box."
set key[id=20301434] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you the luxurious Imperial Gold weapon, with its \
    well-matched gold and red accents. "
set key[id=20301434] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20301435] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you the luxurious Imperial Gold weapon, with its \
    well-matched gold and red accents. "
set key[id=20301435] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20301436] mainDescription "<font size='14'>2 Min Cooldown</font>\\n<font size='24'>Removes Blue \
    Flame</font>"
set key[id=20301436] tooltipDescription "A flower that grew in the chill of the Eternal Cave. Eating it lets its \
    strong cold quench the blue flame. It is so cold that you cannot eat it again for a while."
set key[id=20301436] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to use it."
set key[id=20301442] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you a 5th Anniversary Mushking Coin with a set chance."
set key[id=20301442] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the item.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\""
set key[id=20301764] tooltipDescription "A firework given out to celebrate the Tria Starlight Festival.\n<font \
    color='#ffffff'>It can only be used in $map:02000001$, where the festival is being held. Using it shoots \
    starlight high into the sky and also gets you $item:30001190$.</font>"
set key[id=20301855] tooltipDescription "A firework made for the starlight fireworks show that closes out the Tria \
    Starlight Festival. \n<font color='#ffffff'>It can only be used from 0:00 on Sep 15, 2018 to 23:59:59 on Sep \
    16, 2018, and only in $map:02000001$. Using it shoots starlight high into the sky and also gets you \
    $item:30001190$.</font>"
set key[id=20301856] tooltipDescription "A box holding a chance to turn your MapleStory 2 life around. It can only \
    be opened on Saturdays and Sundays during the event period."
set key[id=20301856] guideDescription "\\n$item:20301856$: what is it?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Sent by mail \
    every 30 minutes while you are logged in on Saturdays and Sundays.\\n- With luck, you can get the 'Winner! \
    Beauty Tycoon Box'.\\n- Even without luck, everyone gets one of various items. \\n- Just opening the box gets \
    you 2 'Starlight Festival Coins'.\\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you can get; \
    many more are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20301857] tooltipDescription "A box holding a chance to turn your MapleStory 2 life around. It can only \
    be opened on Saturdays and Sundays during the event period."
set key[id=20301857] guideDescription "\\n$item:20301857$: what is it?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Sent by mail \
    every 30 minutes while you are logged in on Saturdays and Sundays.\\n- With luck, you can get the 'Winner! \
    Onyx Tycoon Box'.\\n- Even without luck, everyone gets one of various items. \\n- Just opening the box gets \
    you 2 'Starlight Festival Coins'.\\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you can get; \
    many more are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20301858] tooltipDescription "A box holding a chance to turn your MapleStory 2 life around. It can only \
    be opened on Saturdays and Sundays during the event period."
set key[id=20301858] guideDescription "\\n$item:20301858$: what is it?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Sent by mail \
    every 30 minutes while you are logged in on Saturdays and Sundays.\\n- With luck, you can get the 'Winner! \
    Meso Tycoon Box'.\\n- Even without luck, everyone gets one of various items. \\n- Just opening the box gets \
    you 2 'Starlight Festival Coins'.\\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you can get; \
    many more are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20301859] tooltipDescription "A box holding a chance to turn your MapleStory 2 life around. It can only \
    be opened on Saturdays and Sundays during the event period."
set key[id=20301859] guideDescription "\\n$item:20301859$: what is it?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Sent by mail \
    every 30 minutes while you are logged in on Saturdays and Sundays.\\n- With luck, you can get the 'Winner! \
    Necklace Tycoon Box'.\\n- Even without luck, everyone gets one of various items. \\n- Just opening the box \
    gets you 2 'Starlight Festival Coins'.\\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you can \
    get; many more are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20301868] tooltipDescription "A firework made for the starlight fireworks show that closes out the \
    Starlight Festival. \n<font color='#ffffff'>It can only be used from 0:00 on Dec 25, 2020 to 23:59:59 on Dec \
    27, 2020, and only in $map:63000094$. Using it shoots starlight high into the sky and also gets you \
    $item:30001276$. If you take a screenshot of the moment you use the firework by Dec 27, you can enter the \
    Starry Christmas event on the homepage.</font>"
set key[id=20301868] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the item."
set key[id=20301869] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you all 12 beauty coupons for your gender. \\nIf you got \
    this box, you are one of the luckiest people in MapleStory 2 history. The beauty coupons inside are \
    untradable, so think carefully before opening it."
set key[id=20301870] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you 999,999 Onyx Crystals. \\nIf you got this box, you \
    are one of the luckiest people in MapleStory 2 history."
set key[id=20301871] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you 1 billion mesos. \\nIf you got this box, you are one \
    of the luckiest people in MapleStory 2 history."
set key[id=20301872] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you the Peridot Necklace of Great Fortune. \\nIf you got \
    this box, you are one of the luckiest people in MapleStory 2 history."
set key[id=20301884] tooltipDescription "A box containing a Milky Way weapon."
set key[id=20301884] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20301930] tooltipDescription "A box containing $item:20301332$ and $item:20301874$, which instantly \
    give you a title and a mark. You cannot get a title you already own again, so choose carefully."
set key[id=20301930] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302009] tooltipDescription "A box containing potions that boost your combat ability for a set time."
set key[id=20302009] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items inside"
set key[id=20302010] tooltipDescription "A box containing potions that boost your combat ability for a set time."
set key[id=20302010] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items inside"
set key[id=20302065] tooltipDescription "Carry $item:20302065$ and go near the maple tree planted in Queenstown to \
    give it fertilizer so it can grow big and strong. You can give $item:20302065$ only 5 times a day."
set key[id=20302065] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302065$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Received by mail \
    when you log in</font>"
set key[id=20302068] tooltipDescription "A box containing a Bloody Devil weapon."
set key[id=20302068] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20302110] tooltipDescription "A special box made to commemorate G-Star 2018. It holds items that help \
    with growth and adventure, as well as a unique bathtub-shaped flying mount."
set key[id=20302110] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to get various items. \\n\\n<font \
    color='#FFFFFF'>$item:20300531$ contents </font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - 1 Growth Support \
    Coupon</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - 30 Elixirs</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - 30 Expert \
    Potions</font>"
set key[id=20302132] tooltipDescription "A box in which you can choose and get 1 of various construction items \
    that give a strong Christmas feel."
set key[id=20302132] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302202] tooltipDescription "A box holding weapon skins infused with the toughness of the Maple \
    Alliance."
set key[id=20302202] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20302204] tooltipDescription "A box holding weapon skins infused with the loyalty of the Tria Royal \
    Guard."
set key[id=20302204] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20302212] tooltipDescription "A box holding weapon skins infused with the gentle strength of the Green \
    Hoods."
set key[id=20302212] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20302275] tooltipDescription "A box holding weapon skins infused with the pure, clear heart of the \
    Lumiknights."
set key[id=20302275] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20302316] tooltipDescription "A box holding weapon skins infused with the cautious charisma of the Dark \
    Wind."
set key[id=20302316] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20302379] tooltipDescription "A box containing $item:20302380$ and $item:20302381$, which instantly \
    give you a title and a mark. You cannot get a title you already own again, so choose carefully."
set key[id=20302379] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302407] tooltipDescription "A box containing a title and a mark infused with the energy of the cherry \
    blossoms that begin spring."
set key[id=20302407] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the Cherry Blossom Song title and \
    the Cherry Blossom mark. The Cherry Blossom mark is set to in use as soon as you get it.\\n\\n<font \
    color='#FFD200'>Cherry Blossom Mark Effects\\n\\n- Damage against boss monsters increased by 4%\\n- Attack \
    speed increased by 5%\\n\\n</font><font color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The title and mark you get by opening the chosen \
    box are character-bound, so please use it with care.</font>"
set key[id=20302422] tooltipDescription "A box containing a title and a mark that wish for a starlit Christmas."
set key[id=20302422] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the Starlight Christmas title and \
    mark. The mark is set to in use as soon as you get it.\\n\\n<font color='#FFD200'>Starlight Christmas Mark \
    Effects\\n\\n- Attack speed increased by 4%\\n- Physical/magic damage increased by 6%\\n- Damage against boss \
    monsters increased by 3.5%\\n\\n</font><font color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The title and mark you get by opening the box \
    are character-bound, so please use it with care.</font>"
set key[id=20302426] tooltipDescription "A box containing a title and a mark that give you the energy of the \
    roaring black tiger."
set key[id=20302426] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the Roaring Black Tiger title and \
    mark. The mark is set to in use as soon as you get it.\\n\\n<font color='#FFD200'>Roaring Black Tiger Mark \
    Effects\\n\\n- Critical damage increased by 150\\n- Physical/magic damage increased by 7%\\n- Damage against \
    boss monsters increased by 4%\\n\\n</font><font color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The title and mark you get by opening the \
    box are character-bound, so please use it with care.</font>"
set key[id=20302534] tooltipDescription "An item that lets you check any number you want in the Check Check \
    All-Bingo event. Very handy when the Magic Pencil has no number for you to check. Checking 1 number uses up \
    1."
set key[id=20302534] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302534$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Buy at the Meret \
    Market (2 purchases per account per day)\\n- Check Check All-Bingo bingo reward</font>"
set key[id=20302535] tooltipDescription "A box containing a Cherry Blossom weapon."
set key[id=20302535] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon skin for your job."
set key[id=20302622] tooltipDescription "A box containing a Bouncing Kitty weapon."
set key[id=20302622] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon for your job."
set key[id=20302666] tooltipDescription "A box containing an Unknown Universe weapon."
set key[id=20302666] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a weapon for your job."
set key[id=20302681] tooltipDescription "A box in which you can choose the type of Lv. 70 Legendary weapon shard \
    you want"
set key[id=20302681] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302682] tooltipDescription "A box in which you can choose the type of Lv. 70 Legendary armor shard \
    you want"
set key[id=20302682] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302686] tooltipDescription "A box holding skin items for a devoted adventurer."
set key[id=20302686] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items. \\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The contents become character-bound when opened."
set key[id=20302694] tooltipDescription "Pump air in with $item:20302694$ so the Baki pool in Meow Paradise can \
    grow!\r\nYou can use $item:20302694$ 10 times a day."
set key[id=20302694] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302694$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Earned for every 30 \
    minutes logged in each day</font>"
set key[id=20302698] tooltipDescription "Pump air in with $item:20302698$ so the Baki pool in Meow Paradise can \
    grow!\r\nYou can use $item:20302698$ 10 times a day."
set key[id=20302698] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302698$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Earned for every 30 \
    minutes logged in each day</font>"
set key[id=20302708] tooltipDescription "A box in which you can choose the type of mark you want."
set key[id=20302708] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the item. <font \
    color='#FF5F5F'>\\n\\n* The item you get is [Character-Bound], so choose the character that will use it \
    carefully.</font>"
set key[id=20302709] tooltipDescription "A box containing a title and a mark filled with the blessing of the red \
    peony."
set key[id=20302709] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the Red Peony title and the \
    Blessing of the Red Peony mark. The Blessing of the Red Peony mark is set to in use as soon as you get it, and \
    is bound to the character that used it.\\n\\n<font color='#FFD200'>Blessing of the Red Peony Mark \
    Effects\\n\\n- Critical damage increased by 150\\n- Attack speed increased by 4%\\n\\n</font>"
set key[id=20302710] tooltipDescription "A box containing a title and a mark filled with the blessing of the \
    yellow peony."
set key[id=20302710] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the Yellow Peony title and the \
    Blessing of the Yellow Peony mark. The Blessing of the Yellow Peony mark is set to in use as soon as you get \
    it, and is bound to the character that used it.\\n\\n<font color='#FFD200'>Blessing of the Yellow Peony Mark \
    Effects\\n\\n- Damage against boss monsters increased by 7%\\n- Health increased by 500\\n\\n</font>"
set key[id=20302747] tooltipDescription "The Meta Badge only lets you bring out the abilities the Meta Core holds. \
    It is the Meta Core that gathers the magical energy scattered across the Maple World and turns it into stats."
set key[id=20302747] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302626$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n* Given out every \
    Sunday based on time logged in \\n- 60 given after 30 minutes logged in \\n- 40 given after 1 hour logged in \
    \\n- 20 given after 1 hour 30 minutes logged in</font>"
set key[id=20302906] tooltipDescription "A box containing Epic grade $item:30001157$. $item:30001157$ gives the \
    same effect when used in place of gear needed for enchanting, and when used to enchant a dual-wield weapon, 1 \
