    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \nGo to \
    $map:02010016$ to meet $npc:11001374$, a cold city man in neat clothes."
set quest[questID=80000065] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
set quest[questID=80000066] name "Burning Charisma"
